### 變數設定
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/bookings
@auth = Basic vic1 111
@bookingId = 99

### 1-1. 查詢所有預訂 (無條件)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1-2. 條件查詢 (帶入條件參數). ?bookingId=1&bookingOrderId=33&bookingStatus=訂單完成
GET {{baseUrl}}?bookingStatus=訂單完成
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 2. 新增預訂
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingOrderId": 5,
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-01T16:00:00",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-03T12:00:00",
  "guestNum": 2,
  "bookingStatus": "訂單完成",
  "roomId": 5,
  "roomTypeId": 2
}

### 3. 更新預訂
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingOrderId": 5,
  "checkInDate": "2026-09-02T16:00:00",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-09-04T12:00:00",
  "guestNum": 3,
  "bookingStatus": "訂單取消",
  "roomId": 5,
  "roomTypeId": 2
}

### 4. 刪除預訂
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}